{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c042bf3b12a835a6793e38cefcfacc627120f1b85a15011e272efc7f442b8c93",
      "source_sha256": "4e28eb0d335e946efa4ab142722d3a90fffb2527417cfee337e606246a19c35b",
      "translation": "那时的战争，几乎没有留下完整的记录。战场在短时间内化为焦土，难得派出的王国军，也在苦战后全军覆没了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3cc82e1453c67b32e683244f29106ed31f550c2e81061822a02bcc70545bc1a9",
      "source_sha256": "9688173402fb136bd1e8ff4bd8dd780b186a63c004aaa55b8e92bf26362aff47",
      "translation": "而且，发动战争的两名主谋，都销声匿迹了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3e59dfa02f48c1ed533a4869d14842bc729e071b76b417db556b0b8c2c9f5408",
      "source_sha256": "53a8f33c630707524a54f2a67e6126174d28ec85fdd81a5da8a47d8a656ecadd",
      "translation": "确实有很多地方，和这次战争很像。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:888f43cde5ea4394f3d1e92e71220fd74d1bb5193f5f09988e9ae32068ad52a0",
      "source_sha256": "4d2df73d4116baa2f3919b357186dcbe1441e3706c66132e1b5cc7cb7ba9a6b6",
      "translation": "可那不就意味着，每过150年，都会出现一个像修恩扎伊特那样的家伙吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3cb9c40b39c7966e127f45d06cf0ab47fc93e382decbddb5f613573dc2ee50a4",
      "source_sha256": "41fcd2460d9adf5c94f333951aa244faa1b0aee1db6c281eebf4c2b633aa8dab",
      "translation": "这里记载的怪物兵器，或许就是哨兵之类的东西。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:db1af14617a6d1af38f7a8be0deb8e77ace771ffb1f5468710979b082651ce88",
      "source_sha256": "674cc425bbf2d224f0bb2155cf366c4a9029d1d24fb35388ea1e111496b31133",
      "translation": "塔斯和斯拉茨那两个家伙，该不会是修恩扎伊特的祖先吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a0d41d1e4417e1289dce3b7be157e041b02f8ebbeb40b4e091d7dc2aec0896fc",
      "source_sha256": "c9e12327d8914958a19eeef5ccaf445e1fdc553ea107d3d447fee0fbdd03e963",
      "translation": "不好说。我倒觉得，那就是修恩扎伊特本人。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5dfbcb601586c2af7881b83b022ecd2dba35233cad34d40282f910ac9afcfd37",
      "source_sha256": "89f450ebdc8e01ccd3c4f270a3422bb9ebba9d26102fbd4ad2ae79f8da4f24e7",
      "translation": "啊哈哈，怎么可能～人类又不能像特雷瓦族那样长寿。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:46e804ccd46c8827ad33b252f8faa7f871b1cf0d00a73540aab23ea639be55e2",
      "source_sha256": "caa0f5c8e4997bdb2171c56f8ec53b09b3c5b02391d0851d2ba024d42e9a5487",
      "translation": "以前，我接过护送阿维斯族商人的委托，曾从他们口中听过塔斯的事。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:35ff9336ceaf4c39840473ec3e26c884fdd29ef819e2a9c69bddfd96c1e25a55",
      "source_sha256": "b4370a0d9de7aa29d824219124299e58fcbff0a1428d3e41dbf6645d844a93ab",
      "translation": "据说，塔斯当时一直紧盯着一名试图守护阿维斯贝尔克的青年。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c5c064fd65b31ef59a810ce4c75dccce07b3bae6fed0ad9c0d8338b50a1bfffe",
      "source_sha256": "44cf0d075a3e6e282129924f4689072369b2d88f80bc2cd09fd1f2fd9bb785cf",
      "translation": "最后，那名青年被活捉了。似乎在那之后不久，战争便突然结束，灾祸种也随之平息了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2055d81bd66e4cab7f20b0fe8a49d24da8c04cd9a2faf44736019561db37abd4",
      "source_sha256": "53f6d38f71f4726d7f354ff61d9bc33423b65140d4f194e804c88958065e04ff",
      "translation": "难道那家伙，就是玛格纳卡尔塔？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1b1a90e344c9a52e15a31fac74a8aa7696d978bfe22b41627619ab0896af70ef",
      "source_sha256": "c66ecbac57168c7f13c261eaa89b3164bdb582cc4dc20318d6e55a0d77cb9521",
      "translation": "的确……记录里总是写着，战争之后，灾祸种便平息了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7c25ca0d4d80c9ac98c7687fd023a219b9a1651b86e2c16f8f9700411f570b92",
      "source_sha256": "c93931ea0ad475bbfeae5cb9f84fcfa694b7dd15a85ef77d695c3b2f9a4d57dc",
      "translation": "也许在那个时候，他们也找到了玛格纳卡尔塔，并将其牺牲了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cdbb843e158a47b54f2bee884588f64c0319f849398e185950c2dc20b208b74c",
      "source_sha256": "5da6d22234d1d9ef36875ceef4ee4ce3de164cae06e8247f8250d0ab062bcc84",
      "translation": "可是，为什么非要发动战争？伤亡数万人……明明只要牺牲玛格纳卡尔塔，就能结束这一切。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d50bc819925b3866337a0020b976e356162acadf1bbda94ebac832af58acbbc1",
      "source_sha256": "ae2fafc6903367c066ae02d137ec1275deba337f4ce841e300f17a4c7d0aaf0c",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特以前说过，他发动这场战争，是为了让玛格纳卡尔塔成长。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c261bb3b7314a4bcef9f9c7f0ce976dfa77aee4fe90b63d504477aa5d59b0cf5",
      "source_sha256": "16d8b0448002270c08126db0bbfe99a4f27ffb46714541886e632b6cce4c9704",
      "translation": "但我觉得，事情似乎不止如此。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1895f277421a5b1523058bab501c7bc4ec2f48460fc927349cc25ec6e5c19c25",
      "source_sha256": "86b520d5e414f5c72732baa7bce625a79b2826fd20ff75f8ca92b4967c9a1e2f",
      "translation": "我也这么认为。尤其是他们都使用了怪物兵器这一点，想必有什么原因。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be4a309a34aa81bf1b35c82c90f727f6e560bfef662b7c128452ab61b821e71f",
      "source_sha256": "20151fcb6a3d29bfa0bb38d8155b5e80639ca0b41616a47ce1c4714128c2e5e0",
      "translation": "先回柯塔马雷吧。也许该好好整理一下情报。这场战争，肯定藏着什么。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0653b599a0b76ece0cd8158a30335af223dfc25b846ab2719246c669786c057b",
      "source_sha256": "557ee11f5648ebcaa9a073bd8abc3af0c7cfc55ac09c8ddf869bea17ab96e70a",
      "translation": "你们来得正好。我正要找你们。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9a6b31a73a66dfe626fb9d8f328dee8a8bd6977590417b7e42130ac21cf5a90e",
      "source_sha256": "bd720b382a23178f5c6df21de4ac7f7f28e56a8efbb4dd06c78d6a7fa3d06dea",
      "translation": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e5ffd96df65bddf8e8343bfea37b5007e5149d8434e33ab09c47dda673a5d613",
      "source_sha256": "5fde3fdec22ce32db80a22cc2d8fcb329104ce6ccd877fc91e913b84f038ab91",
      "translation": "有个人类女子在村口徘徊，我过去一看，没想到竟然是北部军。所以，本来想杀了她……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7f0d82f238462e5310a686775e341959c95262582584ea3f955b2d25e0e5501b",
      "source_sha256": "48f80a746b5bacc3d2ea87d6aa67be9d5dfd86eda49506ed83d0219122b26929",
      "translation": "北部军的女人……难道是！？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:11f903451d560aa6a44c91f1aafcb493b651563ea5919e4a17bb87b08b783b02",
      "source_sha256": "1b26505cc8351e884976a6e53ba45eb4da8a2692b96d7b509a8465e2ffdbf9df",
      "translation": "她说认识你。所以，我想先确认一下真假，就暂时用麻痹香制住她，把她扣在村子角落里了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3510efe5c062d7ff79d38942fec88129aba6cc211ab482f8262670c914b809a5",
      "source_sha256": "f90c3267288d4f204f91c646e8ebfb2d1827f26845447d1b72d057b534d4a222",
      "translation": "你能亲自确认一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:59c75e81b45581ca38ccc32e05afb8a79d77d1a09f99989a4e3dc26ee8ce5034",
      "source_sha256": "59f8af9f919215b6e9eba049ba0eb5233fda272ea66e980e3c8860c644c1c75c",
      "translation": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cec9188079bc27373677f79842f27682643456ba3d7eaef700ea6143534c2c2e",
      "source_sha256": "6e8f8cdc2f88233123d51cc1b3f23d81da132a8a53626f169c976b59cc685bb8",
      "translation": "梅莉莎！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3f3e800f7634ca519e051a08bfd5883bffa0f1095309843694f1111ed318e9c8",
      "source_sha256": "343006a961a4ca2015293bad24ea3c9a9d685ea696212f88a5a0eca4beb31b19",
      "translation": "原来你在这里……我只是听到传闻才找过来的，还担心会不会就这样见不到你。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5444200c3763efb4806d525210989835c12de1939b65fbe52012c9c5289f1213",
      "source_sha256": "e9a8bceb83ec98bd4dee066f9f57047a02a223da914d583ba5b0ccaa074be858",
      "translation": "这到底是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f1fc07957518cad0467280124c70f36e641cb80ce117919438ec187a4766313b",
      "source_sha256": "40b5aaf9599c68984e765a3360feac72834b2a27a5c8be3884ad39857d3e8fce",
      "translation": "我有话想对你说，所以就来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:200ac4c787ce7674f70982457ab82cdae20bdefb5cca4e669919959126e57841",
      "source_sha256": "de52c345b1242445288c409f9a1bab74da781dc85d6bdf3acbb96e6084309fbc",
      "translation": "你是要我们相信身为北部军的你吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d50cfbb340081f9b78c770e3186b9dbb353c51fb31c775d9139882dcdc0b2cb",
      "source_sha256": "4fed08834b7559e477ba38052e8dc4c54eee789fa383bf60d90c5205c327747a",
      "translation": "你们不相信我也没关系，但一定要听我把话说完。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cce4f4133eacb08a7d91b0e08a14da73c341e8cbf2ca12f2284b28d320975b24",
      "source_sha256": "614a9140d12ce7aff540597fa27700fce83965c138d454fa21bede606279c69a",
      "translation": "因为我要说的事，和这场战争有关。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:973f302cc01569c15ba43a0d1595bd5997cdd1eb1d973d09c4882873cbd3715a",
      "source_sha256": "78e6d8c8fb93c90e332686968b0dcd82758003b43df38441bc20744bb1ef1a80",
      "translation": "而且，我已经不是北部军了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:54b7a5ed40fbc1a3cdc21e6ea6bb621ae0415e1dc02cc83ef1b32b86e6bc432e",
      "source_sha256": "dfedef8d4f5c5ebea1ef04e64a97f653c58a9506fad25cb8de8be3a066343018",
      "translation": "发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9b933affcb023911c394ec18a5695d6147973cc72fefc00075c8c38160a1124d",
      "source_sha256": "c9fd70efa5e13416d2940e9418226fa61de1fbdc4405eaf7a5a8adef20815f0c",
      "translation": "我……曾经一直坚信，北部军才是正义的一方。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cf8abee3a0d244b06af87cf771b1dec6263915ae7b23d313d5cefe578ff8c410",
      "source_sha256": "9f41b49aa3e45e87b5886e6c708f44f646a08625012c41295385c6ea9e402800",
      "translation": "但真相并非如此。所以，我不想再眼看着无辜的人牺牲，才会来到这里。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c18c7a210dedc3e4faaf9aa02687e97226752b2a0f7862afa56b5ad11ac0db09",
      "source_sha256": "a91969c6b9069a60ab6b906018ccc5684bc99dd5eceb559a6610b56e3cfb98a7",
      "translation": "塞蕾丝汀……能先替梅莉莎解除麻痹香的效果吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0cc6e4767ec85ebbd5281dff3be37da094bbc02c21306d95b0df79e4a50bbb20",
      "source_sha256": "e114c9623b93de390a2e9ac18f5c8d1747657d71a89023148df1122f22b0499f",
      "translation": "真的没关系吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8e5eedb065ae5baff371ed2df82f614eba42ecd5dd4771352066ee99d7dcadb4",
      "source_sha256": "b648f93227e1075ec8e5661eb52da499aaa2a833dea0128603ed4e1c56293838",
      "translation": "嗯。请相信梅莉莎。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:504e7d881ad5ba439300d06be6f02b0cd7282ecd83c3563d42eaec5d364d7861",
      "source_sha256": "eaf028285f1e1efd0977e2ffc9ac6b287aa42b05f17e7daab047ccc216aa54d3",
      "translation": "谢谢你，朱特。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:11c7e70328065e22dfc9c3796b0cf8387916bcf16d7bdbf7368bced5e5337e8e",
      "source_sha256": "b06aa3e130e6ffb025ea48678c67d8f275f6439a399613d4696a024398d4ea72",
      "translation": "（难道……是梅莉莎？得去确认一下。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9f87b4ba419325c3f1533f2bf828248929ca210c2ded6c6a6a11f8b633c8e843",
      "source_sha256": "3df2a469590d9c5c52f87111f05ca153851fed021ec1ed9be223bdc7ccb3ea56",
      "translation": "（去见见那个来找我们的北部军吧。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ce2e94db7a5bf46da2115dfadfa60dcd8bfc99fb670595ecc6d33493d3e2aef7",
      "source_sha256": "ad50c05cc4f3088a483c761861c7a72120d1ef44290edd6f7946f7c68966aa9c",
      "translation": "（来找我们的北部军。会是谁呢？）"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a13cefc3d1761b924262b6e85d41a42f929c241f74a8d904c5099293fdbc381a",
      "source_sha256": "a600ac238304455cf034686549244a4e86098db7d3e23618cf648e55d33fd5d1",
      "translation": "（北部军居然来到这里。会是谁呢？）"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1f2317759d9556406778da88f4a42a191ad5410c50012780d89b759011b19031",
      "source_sha256": "b5e686486778621494c94419647c042b2a77541a33960d0fdff70eb6579ac220",
      "translation": "（北部军来找我们，得弄清楚是怎么回事。）",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1816c210781de7c932815abd62854ceab254a664c5e956b5ea2e04ec7ace82d0",
      "source_sha256": "ca57fa60440259084e18d23ae63703f1a64f835f58adc7d508862bc5ef2cc2b2",
      "translation": "（区区北部军，竟敢来到这里。倒要看看是个什么家伙。）",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e3b315543b8e33a88079cc205a2f7c354cce3742b86ccb207d80890d065c9606",
      "source_sha256": "1999a8488cb5c5c9a1d953f3fc15df1706e5c008a0acc23f9d372660b300eefe",
      "translation": "北部军的女战士啊……真担心这件事，又会成为争端的开端。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c7a07b09a1524fe1e40a0e9e76e4f073e8de15fba9b1cbc3210ed664f6d6d034",
      "source_sha256": "f7a7a16844f74530b3838c28b7c73215fda5d887df266a3005c86e60c9037b48",
      "translation": "但愿能平安无事地过去……恐怕没那么容易吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:df513b96da048119f099da0a7e28f73b66057057db6c67b9cb1ea0676ffae9d1",
      "source_sha256": "18b225ff4085d8e707b81e5f99e0f1c4cebab833f1e5767d49b92f2d45c10add",
      "translation": "总之，得先做好准备。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:faa3d82eebb43ae4aaac4eeb11a00935fb36ae6b8327602b9d726b30970dee03",
      "source_sha256": "f7d91eabf584b3c6b8421b77ae56c1dc641374ad69f5a921bbbc001612b70f62",
      "translation": "你说那个北部军的女人？外面的守卫已经向我报告过了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5878d9edb3c64e6a5d105e4e7a31a3ff9a25b28831490a622c930ac98b93f25a",
      "source_sha256": "438bf9ebf7a94789fb41e4847ed30b99fb777020833b80a16d3784e9080691b6",
      "translation": "我以为她是北部军的残党，起初本来想解决掉她，",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:902791b4796f4fb6c1f8d65401e87ce0fcf242ee83d0715a85ca0f467cbb705c",
      "source_sha256": "fe042cc7ec2474107a45a494062a76c44f6c2aefce3a2102a05ba68942aabe8d",
      "translation": "可她一直避而不战，像是有什么话想说，所以就没杀她，只把她拘押起来了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1d470a837b1adb34b9b7ee6894156029b1356e15e5cefd62cb998eddd864f36e",
      "source_sha256": "5bd3f6fcd342e80c123c4eb94c8a3055018818ce94e41878df347ff03057acc1",
      "translation": "如果那个北部军是你们的朋友，那应该可以信任吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8bbf3efd35f46894cff8c0ae3e67e1c59f1ee76c36c37e318e023505833d3541",
      "source_sha256": "22919dcacd18e1fdd1be063eab9e01ddd0ebdaecbafed866a3eca59b86495806",
      "translation": "听说有北部军进了村子，真的没问题吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2190c96e2857f9ba7b638d5ed6a6d496316493847b1b865d68f839484aa75399",
      "source_sha256": "f9d007757ece21b06c364c5b88c6ba8334556d579d667c816da2063eaef738c4",
      "translation": "关于那个北部军，我们相信各位，就全权交给你们处理了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}
